<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Tacoma, Wash..</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Tacoma, Wash..</headline>
<text>
<p>City of Tacoma Washington</p>
<p>RE: $66,925,000</p>
<p>Solid Waste Utility Revenue Refunding Bonds,</p>
<p>1997 Series B &amp; 1997 Series C</p>
<p>Effective at 12:00 Noon E.S.T., Wednesday, April 2, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
